# the fragment links with the text shown: a behaviour, a guard, a name, a label
# and a wrapped behaviour are underlined; a rename dropping a name fragment makes
# an element subject (EDIT-EDGE-21, EDIT-STRUCT-13)
new-action n0 entry/ motor.on()
new-action n0 TIMEOUT [count > 3] / stop()
new-action n0 TICK / alpha beta gamma delta epsilon zeta eta theta iota kappa
new-subject n2 n0 data stop()
new-subject n2 n0 data count
new-subject n2 n1 name Second
new-subject n2 t0 data go()
new-subject n2 n0 data gamma delta epsilon zeta eta theta
new-subject n2 n1 name state
rename n1 Other place
